[background arg="res://Assets/Backgrounds/TestBackground1.png" fade="0.0"]
audio "res://Sounds/Music/jorisvermeer-goofy-cartoon-music-594410.mp3" [volume="-27.0"]
join Kai leftmost
Kai: Hello, how are you doing?
join Boss rightmost
Boss: Whats up Kai
Kai: I wanted to talk to you about something. I was thinking..
Kai: Ive been working really hard and I would like to request to take off next -
Boss: Hey what do you think about this new office setup? I'm thinking I liked how it looked before. I'm leaving soon anyway, not my problem I guess. Globble Globble
Kai: Oh um yes, but -
Boss: You know I think you might actually, globble globble, be a good fit for this position. What do you think?
- No
	Boss: Why??? I knew a human could never be a good employee. Ungrateful trash buckets. Glob glob
	set {chef} += 1.0
- Yes
	Boss: Wonderful! I've got your 80 year contract right here. Just sign here and here. Glub Glub
	set {therapist} += 1.0
- Evil option
	Boss: Dude, why would you say that?? Fuck you. You're fired. But I expect you to come in next week. Glob. We still have that deadline to meet. Glob. Fuck you.
	set {bad} += 1.0
if {chef} == 1.0:
	Kai: I am a chef now
elif {therapist} == 1.0:
	Kai: I am a therapist forever now
elif {bad} == 1.0:
	Kai: This is the evil ending \:(